= Instructions

Add all ingredients:\
@Michters Single Barrel Rye{1 oz}, @Appleton Estate 8 year Rum{1 oz}, @Tempus Fugit Crème de Banane{1/2 oz},
@St Elizabeth Allspice Dram{2 dashes}, @Angostura Bitters{2 dashes} in a #Mixing glass{} and stir.

Serve in a #Rocks glass{} over a large @Ice{} cube with a @Dried banana or plantain{} on a bamboo pick.